Apa yang berlaku?

17:49.270 --> 17:49.890
Kenapa dah habis?

17:49.920 --> 17:50.580
Ada lagi tak?

17:50.790 --> 17:51.270
Ya.

17:51.640 --> 17:52.000
Alamak!

17:52.310 --> 17:53.240
Tenaga rohani Ranran tidak mencukupi.

17:57.960 --> 17:58.480
Alamak!

17:58.790 --> 17:59.720
Kehabisan terlalu banyak tenaga rohani

17:59.750 --> 18:00.790
