19:03.680 --> 19:10.030
Bagus!

19:23.510 --> 19:24.030
Mari minum!

19:24.030 --> 19:25.160
Mari, minum!

19:26.070 --> 19:26.590
Mari!

19:26.790 --> 19:27.310
Ranran.

19:29.310 --> 19:29.970
Pak Seguru Qin.

19:31.680 --> 19:32.880
Apa tujuan awak

19:33.310 --> 19:34.200
untuk saya mengadakan jamuan arak ini?

19:35.310 --> 19:36.960
Tentulah berkenalan sambil menyiasat kes.

19:37.440 --> 19:38.110
Menyiasat kes?

19:40.000 --> 19:40.590
Mari!

19:40.830 --> 19:41.550
Mari minum bersama!

19:42.510 --> 19:43.370
Kalau begitu, terserah awak.

19:43.400 --> 19:43.830
Paksa dia minum.

19:44.200 --> 19:44.790
Awak minum dengan dia!

19:46.030 --> 19:46.750
Mari!

19:46.960 --> 19:47.400
Mari.

19:48.310 --> 19:49.070
Teruskan minum!

19:51.810 --> 19:52.440
Tok guru.

19:52.830 --> 19:53.590
Saya pergi ke sana dulu.

19:54.960 --> 19:55.870
Mari, habiskan.

19:55.920 --> 19:56.880
Mari, habiskan.

19:59.590 --> 20:00.480
Tuan-tuan.

20:02.000 --> 20:02.700
Mari.

20:03.090 --> 20:03.990
Baik, terima kasih.

20:04.680 --> 20:05.270
Main teka-teki jari.

20:06.680 --> 20:07.210
Cik.

20:07.390 --> 20:08.610
Sekarang, minum arak dan main teka-teki jari

20:08.640 --> 20:09.590
