20:10.110 --> 20:11.550
Minum arak harus main kad.

20:12.000 --> 20:12.640
Kad Pertapa.

20:16.030 --> 20:17.240
Pendeta Kaiyuan.

20:17.550 --> 20:18.160
Betul!

20:18.850 --> 20:19.610
Yang terukir di belakang

20:19.640 --> 20:21.270
