22:57.160 --> 22:57.880
Tuan-tuan.

22:58.350 --> 23:00.030
Dah mabuk dan terjatuh?

23:00.660 --> 23:02.010
Simpan pedang dahulu.

23:02.310 --> 23:02.880
Biar begini.

23:03.070 --> 23:04.000
Saya minum secawan.

23:14.750 --> 23:15.760
Awak dah lupa bahawa selepas awak minum,

23:15.790 --> 23:16.640
tumbuh-tumbuhan akan tumbuh dengan lebat?

23:17.790 --> 23:18.790
Secawan saja, tak apa.

23:19.030 --> 23:19.830
Kita perlu menyiasat kes.

23:24.750 --> 23:25.440
Tok guru.

23:25.750 --> 23:26.480
Awak tak reti minum...

23:26.920 --> 23:27.480
Saya tak apa-apa.

23:28.310 --> 23:28.960
Pandai minum.

23:29.480 --> 23:29.920
Jumpa lagi.

23:35.430 --> 23:36.740
Adakah tok guru

23:38.200 --> 23:39.270
